<title>POLAND: Polifarb-C Q2 net rises to PLN 11.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Polifarb-C Q2 net rises to PLN 11.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polifarb Cieszyn preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    18.49   vs   12.78</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			18.02   vs   12.86</p>
<p>    net profit			    11.79   vs    6.89</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Polifarb Cieszyn SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    100.88   vs   88.36</p>
<p>    costs of sales			66.47   vs   61.87</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     6.23   vs    5.98</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.42   vs    1.29</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.88   vs    1.20</p>
<p>    investment			     5.41   vs    3.74</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    27.32   vs   16.61</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			27.24   vs   15.60</p>
<p>    net profit			    17.39   vs    8.41</p>
<p>    net sales			    174.42   vs  147.48</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     118.94   vs  107.39</p>
